{"2398140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bail Force: Cyberpunk Bounty Hunters", "steam_appid": 2398140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4268630], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2398140/extras/462357123d012dff31b695aa9e9d4428.avif?t=1787803280\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2398140/extras/8d9ac4908680b2d6a6ee7ae872372a24.poster.avif?t=1787803280\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2398140/extras/8d9ac4908680b2d6a6ee7ae872372a24.webm?t=1787803280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2398140/extras/8d9ac4908680b2d6a6ee7ae872372a24.mp4?t=1787803280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to New Rise City</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a futuristic city ravaged after war, criminals and automated combat units run rampant. Avenge your fallen friends and secure your next payday through lethal force or mercy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2398140/extras/20ed210e3d8cbd66fd6e9bae4c3caa92.avif?t=1787803280\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2398140/extras/4329d822f274b3c333e99485c6a79da8.poster.avif?t=1787803280\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2398140/extras/4329d822f274b3c333e99485c6a79da8.webm?t=1787803280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2398140/extras/4329d822f274b3c333e99485c6a79da8.mp4?t=1787803280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adaptive Combat System – Enemies That Learn</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daring to push action roguelite design further, Bail Force introduces the Adaptive Combat System, a feature where enemies analyze your preferred fighting style and evolve to counter it.  Your habit of using melee or ranged attacks will be countered by the next wave of enemies. With diverse types of enemies and procedural generation, no battle is ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Add-On Upgrade System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and combine add-ons to change your playstyle. Become a living weapon that overwhelms enemies with sheer force and dynamic movements. Active skills that trigger with every dash and jump, passive abilities that hurt enemies back or protect you when you take damage, enhancement to your melee and ranged attacks, you decide what to combine and integrate to your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2398140/extras/868d220b13214012c1f2512298f64e87.poster.avif?t=1787803280\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2398140/extras/868d220b13214012c1f2512298f64e87.webm?t=1787803280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2398140/extras/868d220b13214012c1f2512298f64e87.mp4?t=1787803280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Arrest System and Two Playable Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between lethal force or arresting them to serve the justice system. Arresting gives you more money than simple kills, and can change your ending if you do enough of them. Want to find out what awaits your character at the end of the hunt? You can try arresting for replayability and multiple endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2398140/extras/9d8d42fda696752b39ff9d4a034cea3e.poster.avif?t=1787803280\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2398140/extras/9d8d42fda696752b39ff9d4a034cea3e.webm?t=1787803280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2398140/extras/9d8d42fda696752b39ff9d4a034cea3e.mp4?t=1787803280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play as <strong>Angel</strong>, a traumatized student out for revenge armed with a DIY exoskeleton, or <strong>Lea</strong>, a professional bounty hunter with nanite implants, fighting to uphold a promise to a friend. Want to make Angel less obsessed with revenge, or make Lea more trigger-happy and merciless? it is all up to you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Classic Arcade Action Meets Modern Roguelite Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the adrenaline rush of classic 2D action games and think fast, because the enemy learns from your habits, and they won't wait to finish you. Beat them and survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Procedural City Hunts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Hunt criminals through broken cityscapes, suspicious buildings, criminal hideouts, and more. Adapt and deliver retribution to the criminals, with style.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2398140/extras/462357123d012dff31b695aa9e9d4428.avif?t=1787803280\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2398140/extras/8d9ac4908680b2d6a6ee7ae872372a24.poster.avif?t=1787803280\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2398140/extras/8d9ac4908680b2d6a6ee7ae872372a24.webm?t=1787803280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2398140/extras/8d9ac4908680b2d6a6ee7ae872372a24.mp4?t=1787803280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to New Rise City</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a futuristic city ravaged after war, criminals and automated combat units run rampant. Avenge your fallen friends and secure your next payday through lethal force or mercy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2398140/extras/20ed210e3d8cbd66fd6e9bae4c3caa92.avif?t=1787803280\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2398140/extras/4329d822f274b3c333e99485c6a79da8.poster.avif?t=1787803280\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2398140/extras/4329d822f274b3c333e99485c6a79da8.webm?t=1787803280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"